// Portal host, injected at compile time. Committed and intentionally empty:
// a base configuration reference must resolve in a fresh clone or xcodebuild
// fails outright with "Unable to open base configuration reference file" —
// it is an error, not a warning, which is how CI stayed red.
//
// Your own host goes in Portal.local.xcconfig (gitignored, optional include
// below). CI passes AMDL_PORTAL_HOST on the xcodebuild command line instead.
// Empty is a supported state: BackendEndpoint returns "" and the app asks the
// user for an address.
AMDL_PORTAL_HOST =

#include? "Portal.local.xcconfig"
